         MACRO ,
&LABEL   $EXIT ,
&LABEL   DS    0H
         LR    R1,R13         Get workarea address
         L     R0,WRKLEND         and size.
         L     R13,4(,R13)    -> Caller's savearea.
         ST    R15,16(,R13)   Set R15.
*        DMSFRET DWORDS=(0),LOC=(1)
         DMSFRET DWORDS=(0),LOC=(1)
         LM    R14,R12,12(R13)  Restore caller's regs and our R15.
         BR    R14            Return to caller.
         MEND  ,